{"id":"translator-and-historical-edition-notes-part-10","label":"Translator and historical edition notes (part 10)","headingNoteRefs":"","context":"","kind":"commentary","blocks":[{"text":"[^n3717]: John xx. 5.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3717"},{"text":"[^n3718]: John xx. 6.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3718"},{"text":"[^n3719]: John xx. 7.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3719"},{"text":"[^n3720]: John xx. 8.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3720"},{"text":"[^n3721]: John xx. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3721"},{"text":"[^n3722]: John xx. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3722"},{"text":"[^n3723]: John xx. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3723"},{"text":"[^n3724]: Probably an Arabic copyist’s emendation (addition of alif) for stood.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3724"},{"text":"[^n3725]: John xx. 12.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3725"},{"text":"[^n3726]: John xx. 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3726"},{"text":"[^n3727]: John xx. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3727"},{"text":"[^n3728]: John xx. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3728"},{"text":"[^n3729]: cf., § 10, 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3729"},{"text":"[^n3730]: John xx. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3730"},{"text":"[^n3731]: John xx. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3731"},{"text":"[^n3732]: cf. § 12, 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3732"},{"text":"[^n3733]: Mark xvi. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3733"},{"text":"[^n3734]: Matt. xxviii. 11b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3734"},{"text":"[^n3735]: The Vat. ms. has a form that is distinctively plural. The Borg. ms. uses, with a plural adjective, the form found in § 52, 43. In the next verse the relation of the mss. is reversed.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3735"},{"text":"[^n3736]: Matt. xxviii. 12.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3736"},{"text":"[^n3737]: Matt. xxviii. 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3737"},{"text":"[^n3738]: Matt. xxviii. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3738"},{"text":"[^n3739]: Matt. xxviii. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3739"},{"text":"[^n3740]: John xx. 18.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3740"},{"text":"[^n3741]: Matt. xxviii. 8b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3741"},{"text":"[^n3742]: The word first is less correctly spelled in Borg. ms.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3742"},{"text":"[^n3743]: The Vat. ms. omits women and to inform his disciples.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3743"},{"text":"[^n3744]: Informis dual and masc. in the ms., while the other verbs and pronouns are plural and feminine.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3744"},{"text":"[^n3745]: The Vat. ms. omits women and to inform his disciples.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3745"},{"text":"[^n3746]: Matt. xxviii. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3746"},{"text":"[^n3747]: Matt. xxviii. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3747"},{"text":"[^n3748]: Luke xxiv. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3748"},{"text":"[^n3749]: Mark xvi. 10b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3749"},{"text":"[^n3750]: Luke xxiv. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3750"},{"text":"[^n3751]: Mark xvi. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3751"},{"text":"[^n3752]: Luke xxiv. 11a.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3752"},{"text":"[^n3753]: Mark xvi. 12a; Luke xxiv. 13b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3753"},{"text":"[^n3754]: Lit. mils.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3754"},{"text":"[^n3755]: Luke xxiv. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3755"},{"text":"[^n3756]: Luke xxiv. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3756"},{"text":"[^n3757]: Luke xxiv. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3757"},{"text":"[^n3758]: Luke xxiv. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3758"},{"text":"[^n3759]: Luke xxiv. 18.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3759"},{"text":"[^n3760]: Luke xxiv. 19.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3760"},{"text":"[^n3761]: Luke xxiv. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3761"},{"text":"[^n3762]: Borg. ms., to judgement and.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3762"},{"text":"[^n3763]: Luke xxiv. 21.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3763"},{"text":"[^n3764]: Borg. ms. omits all.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3764"},{"text":"[^n3765]: Luke xxiv. 22.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3765"},{"text":"[^n3766]: Luke xxiv. 23.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3766"},{"text":"[^n3767]: Masc. Plural.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3767"},{"text":"[^n3768]: Luke xxiv. 24.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3768"},{"text":"[^n3769]: Luke xxiv. 25.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3769"},{"text":"[^n3770]: Luke xxiv. 26.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3770"},{"text":"[^n3771]: Luke xxiv. 27.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3771"},{"text":"[^n3772]: Luke xxiv. 28.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3772"},{"text":"[^n3773]: Luke xxiv. 29.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3773"},{"text":"[^n3774]: cf. § 50, 36, note.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3774"},{"text":"[^n3775]: Luke xxiv. 30.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3775"},{"text":"[^n3776]: Luke xxiv. 31.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3776"},{"text":"[^n3777]: Vat. ms. omits this clause.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3777"},{"text":"[^n3778]: Luke xxiv. 32.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3778"},{"text":"[^n3779]: Luke xxiv. 33.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3779"},{"text":"[^n3780]: Luke xxiv. 34.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3780"},{"text":"[^n3781]: Luke xxiv. 35.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3781"},{"text":"[^n3782]: Mark xvi. 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3782"},{"text":"[^n3783]: Luke xxiv. 36a; John xx. 19.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3783"},{"text":"[^n3784]: The Arabic word after together looks as if it might be due to a misreading of the Syriac, but it is probably a usage cited by Dozy, Supplément, etc., i., 247.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3784"},{"text":"[^n3785]: Luke xxiv. 36c.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3785"},{"text":"[^n3786]: Luke xxiv. 37.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3786"},{"text":"[^n3787]: Luke xxiv. 38.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3787"},{"text":"[^n3788]: Lit. on (cf. Pesh.).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3788"},{"text":"[^n3789]: Luke xxiv. 39.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3789"},{"text":"[^n3790]: Luke xxiv. 40.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3790"},{"text":"[^n3791]: Borg. ms. has sides.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3791"},{"text":"[^n3792]: Luke xxiv. 41.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3792"},{"text":"[^n3793]: Luke xxiv. 42.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3793"},{"text":"[^n3794]: Borg. ms. omits and of honey.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3794"},{"text":"[^n3795]: Luke xxiv. 43.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3795"},{"text":"[^n3796]: Luke xxiv. 44.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3796"},{"text":"[^n3797]: Vat. ms.,for.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3797"},{"text":"[^n3798]: Luke xxiv. 45.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3798"},{"text":"[^n3799]: Luke xxiv. 46.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3799"},{"text":"[^n3800]: Borg. ms. omits it is necessary.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3800"},{"text":"[^n3801]: Luke xxiv. 47.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3801"},{"text":"[^n3802]: Luke xxiv. 48.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3802"},{"text":"[^n3803]: Luke xxiv. 49a; John xx. 20b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3803"},{"text":"[^n3804]: John xx. 21.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3804"},{"text":"[^n3805]: John xx. 22.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3805"},{"text":"[^n3806]: John xx. 23.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3806"},{"text":"[^n3807]: John xx. 24.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3807"},{"text":"[^n3808]: John xx. 25.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3808"},{"text":"[^n3809]: John xx. 26.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3809"},{"text":"[^n3810]: John xx. 27.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3810"},{"text":"[^n3811]: John xx. 28.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3811"},{"text":"[^n3812]: John xx. 29.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3812"},{"text":"[^n3813]: John xx. 30.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3813"},{"text":"[^n3814]: John xx. 31.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3814"},{"text":"[^n3815]: cf. Peshitta.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3815"},{"text":"[^n3816]: John xxi. 1.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3816"},{"text":"[^n3817]: John xxi. 2.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3817"},{"text":"[^n3818]: Apparently the Vat. ms. means to translate the word. The Borg. ms. retains Tama, as both mss. did in § 37, 61.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3818"},{"text":"[^n3819]: John xxi. 3.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3819"},{"text":"[^n3820]: John xxi. 4.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3820"},{"text":"[^n3821]: John xxi. 5.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3821"},{"text":"[^n3822]: John xxi. 6.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3822"},{"text":"[^n3823]: So Peshitta. Vat. ms. has a form that might possibly be a corruption of take.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3823"},{"text":"[^n3824]: Or, were taken.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3824"},{"text":"[^n3825]: John xxi. 7.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3825"},{"text":"[^n3826]: John xxi. 8.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3826"},{"text":"[^n3827]: Vat. ms. adds unto Jesus.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3827"},{"text":"[^n3828]: John xxi. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3828"},{"text":"[^n3829]: John xxi. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3829"},{"text":"[^n3830]: John xxi. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3830"},{"text":"[^n3831]: John xxi. 12.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3831"},{"text":"[^n3832]: John xxi. 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3832"},{"text":"[^n3833]: John xxi. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3833"},{"text":"[^n3834]: John xxi. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3834"},{"text":"[^n3835]: John xxi. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3835"},{"text":"[^n3836]: Lit. rams.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3836"},{"text":"[^n3837]: John xxi. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3837"},{"text":"[^n3838]: John xxi. 18.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3838"},{"text":"[^n3839]: Lit. ewes. For the three words cf. Peshitta and Sinaitic.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3839"},{"text":"[^n3840]: John xxi. 19.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3840"},{"text":"[^n3841]: John xxi. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3841"},{"text":"[^n3842]: cf. § 45, 3, note.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3842"},{"text":"[^n3843]: John xxi. 21.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3843"},{"text":"[^n3844]: Lit. of him.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3844"},{"text":"[^n3845]: John xxi. 22.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3845"},{"text":"[^n3846]: John xxi. 23.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3846"},{"text":"[^n3847]: John xxi. 24.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3847"},{"text":"[^n3848]: Matt. xxviii. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3848"},{"text":"[^n3849]: Vat. ms. omits to the mountain.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3849"},{"text":"[^n3850]: Matt. xxviii. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3850"},{"text":"[^n3851]: Mark xvi. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3851"},{"text":"[^n3852]: This seems to be the meaning of the text of the mss. Ciasca conjecturally emends it by printing in his Arabic text because they after hearts; but this is of no use unless one also ignores the and before believed.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3852"},{"text":"[^n3853]: Matt. xxviii. 18b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3853"},{"text":"[^n3854]: John xx. 21b; Mark xvi. 15b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3854"},{"text":"[^n3855]: Matt. xxviii. 19b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3855"},{"text":"[^n3856]: Or, make disciples of.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3856"},{"text":"[^n3857]: Matt. xxviii. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3857"},{"text":"[^n3858]: Mark xvi. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3858"},{"text":"[^n3859]: Mark xvi. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3859"},{"text":"[^n3860]: Not the usual word, although that is used in the Peshitta.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3860"},{"text":"[^n3861]: Mark xvi. 18.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3861"},{"text":"[^n3862]: The Arabic translator renders it the poison of death.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3862"},{"text":"[^n3863]: Luke xxiv. 49b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3863"},{"text":"[^n3864]: Mark xvi. 19a; Luke xxiv. 50.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3864"},{"text":"[^n3865]: Luke xxiv. 51; Mark xvi. 19c.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3865"},{"text":"[^n3866]: Luke xxiv. 52.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3866"},{"text":"[^n3867]: Luke xxiv. 53.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3867"},{"text":"[^n3868]: Mark xvi. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3868"},{"text":"[^n3869]: cf. Peshitta.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3869"},{"text":"[^n3870]: John xxi. 25.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3870"},{"text":"[^n3871]: In the Borg. ms. the text ends on folio 353a. On folios 354a-355a are found the genealogies, with the title, Book of the Generation of Jesus, that of Luke following that of Matthew without any break. Ciasca has told us nothing of the nature of the text. The Subscription follows on folio 355b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3871"},{"text":"[^n3872]: See note 1 to Introductory Note in Borg. ms. (above, p. 42).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3872"},{"text":"[^n3873]: ms., by misplacing the diacritical signs, has Ghobasi.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3873"},{"text":"[^n3874]: The ms. has Mottayyib; but Ciasca, in an additional note inserted after the volume was printed, gives the correct form.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3874"},{"text":"[^n3875]: The Arabic text of this Subscription is given by Ciasca in his essay, De Tatiani Diatessaron arabica Versione, in I. B. Pitra’s Analecta Sacra, tom. iv., p. 466.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n3875"}],"chars":5624,"notes":{}}
